<ContentLayout title="Lumen Browser — Part of the Aurora ecosystem" description="Lumen is the browser being developed as part of the Aurora ecosystem. It is not publicly released." heading="Lumen Browser." lead="The browser workstream of the Aurora ecosystem, designed to complement Aurora OS as part of one connected computing project.">
  <section class="section shell content-columns">
    <div><h2>In development. Not released.</h2><p class="content-copy">Lumen is not available as a public browser download yet. Its supported platforms, compatibility and release date have not been announced.</p></div>
    <div><h2>Part of Aurora</h2><p class="content-copy">Aurora OS is the foundation of the ecosystem. Lumen is one of the applications being developed alongside it, with its own implementation and release requirements.</p></div>
  </section>
  <section class="section shell article-content">
    <h2>What comes next</h2>
    <p class="content-copy">When Lumen is ready for public use, this page will describe its supported platforms, installation options and key features. Until then, it remains an in-development part of Aurora rather than a downloadable product.</p>
